# The repo's canonical text form is LF, in the working tree and in the blob alike. The sources
# carry Chinese prose, and a `*.ps1` with any non-ASCII in it carries the UTF-8 BOM Windows
# PowerShell 5.1 needs: read without one, its bytes come back in the machine's codepage. `*.cmd`
# is the one exception, since cmd.exe wants CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf